{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54237","headline":"六合怀古诗 惜水湾 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 惜水湾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惜水纡回惧水奔，春潮带雨晚流浑。\n灵岩滁口常萦遶，沙际矶头只见痕。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》注：「见《成化志》，参之《嘉定志》，有数字不同，正之，後多改正。\n「）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}